{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/0xLogicrw/status/2111647451384037421","id":"2111647451384037421","text":"Perplexity 宣布将开源逆向工程工具 REA（Reverse Engineer Anything）接入 Computer。用户只需告诉 AI 想复刻哪款软件，它就能在没有原始源代码的情况下，分析软件的运行方式，再尝试重新编写一个功能相似的版本。\n\nPerplexity 一口气展示了 5 款复刻作品，全部提供可在线体验的网页版本：\n\n1. Figma：支持图层、自动布局、多人实时协作，以及账号登录和跨设备同步。\n2. LibreOffice Calc：支持编辑单元格、编写公式，修改数据后图表自动更新。\n3. Photopea：类似网页版 Photoshop，支持图层、蒙版、调色和文字编辑。\n4. Harvey：面向法律工作的 AI 工具，可以搜索合同、比较不同版本，并根据指定规则标记条款，附上原文引用。\n5. Audacity：支持音频剪辑、混音、音量调整、淡入淡出，以及导出 WAV 文件。\n\nREA 由开发者 morluto 开源，能够配合 Ghidra、Hopper 等工具，分析程序内部的函数、调用关系和运行行为，也能检查网页及 JavaScript、Electron 应用。不过，这并不意味着 AI 已经能完整复制商业软件。REA 作者明确表示，工具无法保证还原原始源码。\n\nPerplexity 为这项功能提供限时免费额度。10 月 31 日前，使用 `/reverse-engineer` 的任务可享受每人最多 10,000 Credits 的免费额度。","raw_text":{"text":"Perplexity 宣布将开源逆向工程工具 REA（Reverse Engineer Anything）接入 Computer。用户只需告诉 AI 想复刻哪款软件，它就能在没有原始源代码的情况下，分析软件的运行方式，再尝试重新编写一个功能相似的版本。\n\nPerplexity 一口气展示了 5 款复刻作品，全部提供可在线体验的网页版本：\n\n1. Figma：支持图层、自动布局、多人实时协作，以及账号登录和跨设备同步。\n2. LibreOffice Calc：支持编辑单元格、编写公式，修改数据后图表自动更新。\n3. Photopea：类似网页版 Photoshop，支持图层、蒙版、调色和文字编辑。\n4. Harvey：面向法律工作的 AI 工具，可以搜索合同、比较不同版本，并根据指定规则标记条款，附上原文引用。\n5. Audacity：支持音频剪辑、混音、音量调整、淡入淡出，以及导出 WAV 文件。\n\nREA 由开发者 morluto 开源，能够配合 Ghidra、Hopper 等工具，分析程序内部的函数、调用关系和运行行为，也能检查网页及 JavaScript、Electron 应用。不过，这并不意味着 AI 已经能完整复制商业软件。REA 作者明确表示，工具无法保证还原原始源码。\n\nPerplexity 为这项功能提供限时免费额度。10 月 31 日前，使用 `/reverse-engineer` 的任务可享受每人最多 10,000 Credits 的免费额度。","display_text_range":[0,642],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"0xLogicrw","url":"https://x.com/0xLogicrw","id":"991319283786395650","followers":8185,"following":2851,"likes":7359,"media_count":1147,"name":"思维怪怪","description":"写关于 AI 的一切 Shit Post\nAI 信息流：https://t.me/OneMillion_AI","raw_description":{"text":"写关于 AI 的一切 Shit Post\nAI 信息流：https://t.co/eiiP41UIFl","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[28,51],"original":"https://t.co/eiiP41UIFl","replacement":"https://t.me/OneMillion_AI","display":"t.me/OneMillion_AI"}]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/991319283786395650/1785523266","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2083261639135244288/KoOQO6zp_200x200.jpg","joined":"Tue May 01 14:11:49 +0000 2018","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":13,"retweets":22,"likes":248,"bookmarks":304,"quotes":4,"created_at":"Sun Oct 18 02:35:59 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1792290959,"views":27771,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"zh","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"quote":{"url":"https://x.com/AskPerplexity/status/2111120664543596957","id":"2111120664543596957","text":"REA (Reverse Engineer Anything) by @morluto is now a skill in Computer.\n\nAsk Computer to reverse-engineer an app and it inspects how the app works without its source code, then builds a working version.\n\nTasks that use /reverse-engineer are free through October 31, up to 10,000 credits per user.\n\nHere are 5 apps Computer made with it, available to try for a limited time:\n\n1) Figma: Design with layers and auto-layout, plus sign-in, cross-device sync, and multiplayer editing. Try it: http://ui-editing.pplx.app","raw_text":{"text":"REA (Reverse Engineer Anything) by @morluto is now a skill in Computer.\n\nAsk Computer to reverse-engineer an app and it inspects how the app works without its source code, then builds a working version.\n\nTasks that use /reverse-engineer are free through October 31, up to 10,000 credits per user.\n\nHere are 5 apps Computer made with it, available to try for a limited time:\n\n1) Figma: Design with layers and auto-layout, plus sign-in, cross-device sync, and multiplayer editing. Try it: https://t.co/FGGTblkCWY","display_text_range":[0,510],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[35,43],"original":"morluto","id":"2032890976533098498"},{"type":"media","indices":[279,302],"id":"2111120616019644416","display":"pic.x.com/GAlDt4sDZJ","origina